# `discover`/`replay` write a timestamped/uuid-named evidence bundle here on every local run by
# default — that's noise, not a deliverable, so it's ignored. The curated bundles assembled for
# submission (see evidence/README.md) are real screenshots + logs from real runs and are
# committed explicitly via the negation patterns below — do NOT re-add a blanket
# `screenshots/*.png` ignore here, or the one thing §3.5/§6's evidence requirement asks for
# (real screenshots in the repo, not just a description of them) silently stops being true.
/evidence/*/
!/evidence/artifacts/
!/evidence/discovery-run/
!/evidence/replay-runs/
